Subject: set StartupWMClass to the Wayland app_id org.kde.kgraphviewer

KGraphViewer takes its app_id from KAboutData, which derives
org.kde.kgraphviewer, the desktop file name; upstream's class names no
window KGraphViewer opens.

--- a/src/org.kde.kgraphviewer.desktop
+++ b/src/org.kde.kgraphviewer.desktop
@@ -51,7 +51,7 @@
 Exec=kgraphviewer -qwindowtitle %c %u
 Icon=kgraphviewer
 Type=Application
-StartupWMClass=kgraphviewer
+StartupWMClass=org.kde.kgraphviewer
 Categories=Qt;KDE;Graphics;Viewer;2DGraphics;DataVisualization;
 X-DocPath=kgraphviewer/index.html
 InitialPreference=10
